ends this product? <\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRRecommended\">No<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRecommendedSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"1 out of 5\" title=\"1 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-60px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">1<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Disappointed<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">08/05/2025<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2025-08-05\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText394422749_21elwd49qtbdv5xfcjc7namsh_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">The product was delivered quickly. It was packaged nicely and all of the parts were in the box. The product was easy to assemble, lightweight, and cute. However, my disappointment begins with the long charging time. The mower only runs for thirty<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText394422749_21elwd49qtbdv5xfcjc7namsh_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview394422749_is416q0iqep4upj567ltqjrzk_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview394422749_is416q0iqep4upj567ltqjrzk_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">The product was delivered quickly. It was packaged nicely and all of the parts were in the box. The product was easy to assemble, lightweight, and cute. However, my disappointment begins with the long charging time. The mower only runs for thirty minutes, at best, on a full charge. It takes over two hours to fully charge the batteries. The constant need to stop, unhook the batteries, walk back to the charging ports, wait for the batteries to recharge, and plug the batteries back into the mower turned what is normally an hour and a half job into a six to seven hour nightmare. Additionally, it appears the batteries cannot tolerate hot weather because I had to wait over thirty minutes for the batteries to cool down before I could begin the changing process. Lastly, the mower\u2019s cutting ability also falls short. This device is only good for maintaining small lawns that have already been tamed by prior cuttings. In short, I\u2019m going to have to return this item.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText394422749_21elwd49qtbdv5xfcjc7namsh_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview394422749_is416q0iqep4upj567ltqjrzk_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">+<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">1<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">point<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/13660751856/review/394422749/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F13660751856%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sor